("h","2. Architecture"),
("c",["x₁ → q₀ |0⟩","x₂ → q₁ |0⟩"],[("U2",0,1,"U_φ(x)\nencode",0),("U2",0,1,"W(θ)\nlayers",1),("M",0,2)],"QNN circuit: feature map U_φ(x) encodes data, trainable layers W(θ) process it, measurement gives the prediction",["ŷ",""],4.2),
("p","**Components:** U_φ(x) (e.g. ZZFeatureMap) = encoding/input layer; W(θ) (e.g. RealAmplitudes with RY rotations and CNOT entanglers) = trainable hidden layers; measurement = output neuron; a classical optimiser (outside the circuit) updates θ."),
