("def","**Classification (pattern recognition)** assigns labels/categories to data points based on patterns learnt from labelled examples – e.g. spam vs not spam, handwritten digits, cats vs dogs. **Quantum classification** uses quantum states (superposition, entanglement) to perform classification **faster or with richer feature spaces** than classical methods (QAI-ii.pdf p.30)."),
("h","1. General workflow"),
