("d",dg('a[label="Labelled data"]; b[label="Quantum encoding\\n(feature map)"]; c[label="Quantum classifier\\n(QSVM kernel / QNN circuit)",fillcolor="#E2EFDA"]; d[label="Measure\\n→ class probabilities"]; e[label="Predicted label",shape=oval]; f[label="Loss vs true labels\\n→ optimiser updates θ",fillcolor="#FFF2CC"]; a->b->c->d->e; d->f->c[constraint=false];',"LR"),"Workflow of quantum machine-learning classification",6.3),
("h","2. Quantum classification algorithms"),
