("h","Key definitions"),
("b",["**QNNS:** distances in superposition + Grover → O(√N); swap test for distance.","**Quantum boosting:** select weak learners → encode → quantum evaluation → weight α = ½ ln((1−ε)/ε) → weighted vote → repeat.","**HHL:** solves Ax = b; encode |b⟩, e^(iAt), QPE, 1/λ rotation, inverse QPE, measure; O(log N κ²) vs O(Nκ).","**SVM vs QSVM:** kernel trick on CPU vs quantum feature map in 2ⁿ-dim Hilbert space; classical practical now, QSVM promising.","**QSVM:** |φ(x)⟩, U(θ)/quantum kernel |⟨φ(x)|φ(y)⟩|², measure, classify; circle example.","**VQA:** ansatz → prepare → measure E(θ) → classical optimiser → repeat (VQE, QAOA, VQC).","**QNN:** encoding, quantum neurons, layers, measurement & learning; XOR example.","**Regression:** w = (XᵀX)⁻¹Xᵀy via quantum linear algebra; QSVR, QNN, kernel, variational."]),
("h","Formulas"),
